# Enchanting
Jewellery plus runes into enchanted jewellery.

```table
Method                                              Cost  Profit    ROI
------------------------------------------------  ------  ------  -----
Enchant Dragonstone amulet into Amulet of glory   11,645     601   5.2%
Enchant Sapphire necklace into Games necklace(8)     670     207  30.9%
Enchant Emerald ring into Ring of dueling(8)         767     102  13.3%
```
=> /ge/calc-enchanting/ench-glory Enchant Dragonstone amulet into Amulet of glory
=> /ge/calc-enchanting/ench-games Enchant Sapphire necklace into Games necklace(8)
=> /ge/calc-enchanting/ench-dueling Enchant Emerald ring into Ring of dueling(8)

## Notes
* gp/hour uses a typical action rate for the method and assumes you never wait on a buy offer. Treat it as an upper bound.
* Rows marked "no price" reference an item nobody has traded recently, so no profit can be computed for them honestly.

=> https://grandexchange.dreamstation.systems/calc/enchanting This page on the web
